OL,3,GNEWSAEarly release scheme won't work
OL,4,Awithout us, says ex-prisoner
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former prisoner who runs a support
OL,7,Fnetwork for ex-offenders said
OL,8,Fgovernment plans to release inmates
OL,9,Fearly would fail to ease prison
OL,10,Fovercrowding without support from
OL,11,Fpeople who had experienced the system
OL,12,Fthemselves.
OL,14,FJamie Dale, 47, from Rochdale, in
OL,15,FGreater Manchester, spent more than 11
OL,16,Fyears in prison for his involvement in
OL,17,Forganised crime. He now runs the Old
OL,18,FLags Network, which aims to cut
OL,19,Freoffending and bridge the gap between
OL,20,Fprison and the community.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
